OL,3,GNEWSALidl submits plans to develop new
OL,4,ADevon store
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupermarket chain Lidl has submitted
OL,7,Fplans to develop a store in Devon's
OL,8,Fnewest town.
OL,10,FLidl has put in proposals on the edge
OL,11,Fof Cranbrook, within the consented
OL,12,FTresbeare expansion area that is set to
OL,13,Fsee just over 1,000 homes built on what
OL,14,Fis now agricultural land.
OL,16,FLidl's plans for London Road,
OL,17,FCranbrook, would also include four
OL,18,Fother retail and commercial units,
OL,19,Fwhich documents suggest could be used
OL,20,Ffor the likes of shops or coffee shops.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
